  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni"><head>ΘΥΕΣΤΗΣ ΕΝ ΣΙΚΥΩΝΙ Η ΣΙΚΥΩΝΙΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="234" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-234" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:235">
            <note type="source">Stobæus Eclog. phys. I, 5. p. 156. Heer.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πρὸς τὴν ἀνάγκην οὐδ᾽ Ἄρης ἀνθίσταται.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="235" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-235" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:236">
            <note type="source">Stobæus Floril. XXIX, 1.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὡς νυν τάχος στείχωμεν. οὐ γὰρ ἔσθ᾽ ὅπως</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">σπουδῆς δικαίας μῶμος ἅπτεταί ποτε.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="236" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-236" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:237">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CVIII, 21.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔχει μὲν ἀλγείν, οἶδα, πειρᾶσθαι δὲ χρὴ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὡς ῥᾷστα τἀναγκαῖα τοῦ βίου φέρειν.</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν τοιούτων χρή τιν᾽ ἴασιν λαβεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="237" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-237" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:238">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXIII, 12.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔνεστι γάρ τις καὶ λόγοισιν ἡδονὴ,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">λήθην ὅταν ποιῶσι τῶν ὄντων κακῶν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="238" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-238" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:239">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXV, 16.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καίπερ γέρων ὢν, ἀλλὰ τῷ γήρᾳ φιλεῖ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">χὼ νοῦς ὁμαρτεῖν καὶ τὸ βουλεύειν ἃ δεῖ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="239" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-239" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:234">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Euripidis Phœnissar. 227.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Σοφοκλῆς δὲ ἐν Θυέστῃ ἱστορεῖ καὶ παρ᾽ Εὐβοεῦσιν ὁμοίαν ἄμπελον εἶναι τῇ ἐν Παρνασῷ, λέγων οὕτως</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔστι γάρ τις ἐναλία</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Εὐβοιὶς αἷα· τῇδε βάκχειος βότρυς</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἦμαρ ἔρπει· πρῶτα μὲν λαμπρᾶς ἕω</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">κεκλημάτωται χῶρος εὐανθὲς δέμας·</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">εἰτ᾽ ἦμαρ αὔξει μέσσον ὄμφακος τύπον,</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">καὶ κλίνεταί γε κἀποπερκοῦται βότρυς·</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">δείλῃ δὲ πᾶσα τέμνεται βλαστουμένη</l>
              <l n="8" xml:lang="grc">καλῶς ὀπώρα, κἀνακίρναται ποτόν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="240" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-240" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:240">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀκήρυκτον: ἄγνωστον. ἀφανες δὲ Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="241" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-241" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:241">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄλογα: ἄρρητα. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="242" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-242" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:242">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀλωπός: ἀλωπεκώδης, πανοῦργος. Σ. Θυέστῃ καὶ Ἰνάχῳ. οἱ δὲ ἀφανὴς κατὰ τὴν πρόσοψιν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="243" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-243" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:228">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀμόρφωτον: ἀδιατύπωτον. Σ. Θυέστῃ τῷ ἐν Σικυώνι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="244" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-244" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:243">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀνταίρουσιν: ἀντιλέγουσιν. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="245" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-245" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:244">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀπείρονας: ἀπειράτους. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="246" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-246" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:245">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀπόθεα: ἄθεα, ἐκτὸς θεῶν. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="247" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-247" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:227">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀποπλήκτῳ ποδί: μανιώδει. Σ. Θ. Σικυωνίῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="248" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-248" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:246">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀτελῆ: αδάπανα, οὐκ ἔχοντα τελέσματα. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="249" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-249" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:229">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Αὐτόμοιρος: μονόμοιρος. Σ. Θ. Σικυωνίῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="250" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-250" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:230">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Αὐτόφορτοι: αὐτοδιάκονοι. κυρίως δὲ οἱ ἐν τοῖς ἰδίοις πλοίοις. Σ. Θ. Σικυωνίῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="251" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-251" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:232">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀφωσιωμέναι: ἀνόσιαι, ἄπωθεν τοῦ ὁσίου γεγενημέναι. Σ. Θυέστῃ δευτέρῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="252" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-252" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:247">
            <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 94, 8. Ἐντέλλω: ἀντὶ τοῦ ἐντέλλομαι. Σ. Θ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="253" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-253" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:231">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐπαίνους: τὰς κρίσεις, καὶ τὰς συμβουλίας, καὶ τὰς ἀρχαιρεσίας. Σ. Θ. Σικυωνίῳ. quibus in cod. hæc adduntur, καὶ ἀλκέοι ταῖς ἐπαινήταισιν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="254" xml:id="fragment-thyestes_en_sikyoni-dindorf1893_grc1-254" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_thyestes_en_sikyoni" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.thyestes_en_sikyoni.nauck1889grc1:233">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἠγόμην διήγον. Σ. Θ. δευτέρῳ.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
